### Phase 2: Refactoring & Architecture Implementation

**1. Flawless Navigation & UI/UX State**
*   **Scroll Restoration:** Strip out any CSS that traps scrolling. Ensure the document `body` handles the scroll so Next.js `<Link>` components natively scroll to `(0,0)` on route change. If a custom container is strictly required, implement a `usePathname` effect to manually trigger `element.scrollTo(0, 0)`.
